e\\\" to Chang'an.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1011477,\"title\":\"Karate Kid: Legends\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/c90Lt7OQGsOmhv6x4JoFdoHzw5l.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7Q2CmqIVJuDAESPPp76rWIiA0AD.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a family tragedy, kung fu prodigy Li Fong is uprooted from his home in Beijing and forced to move to New York City with his mother. When a new friend needs his help, Li enters a karate competition – but his skills alone aren't enough. Li's kung fu teacher Mr. Han enlists original Karate Kid Daniel LaRusso for help, and Li learns a new way to fight, merging their two styles into one for the ultimate martial arts showdown.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Adventure\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1011985,\"title\":\"Kung Fu Panda 4\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kDp1vUBnMpe8ak4rjgl3cLELqjU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3ffPx9jqg0yj9y1KWeagT7D20CB.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Po is gearing up to become the spiritual leader of his Valley of Peace, but also needs someone to take his place as Dragon Warrior. As such, he will train a new kung fu practitioner for the spot and will encounter a villain called the Chameleon who conjures villains from the past.\",\"genres\":[\"Animation\",\"Comedy\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":98566,\"title\":\"Teenage Mutant Ninja Turtles\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/azL2ThbJMIkts3ZMt3j1YgBUeDB.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/eezsbzYPbYKjjh6E1XHDBNlLynh.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When a kingpin threatens New York City, a group of mutated turtle warriors must emerge from the shadows to protect their home.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":399579,\"title\":\"Alita: Battle Angel\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xRWht48C2V8XNfzvPehyClOvDni.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jXDselREPq8TOVGM4dzBBUM7xVk.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When Alita awakens with no memory of who she is in a future world she does not recognize, she is taken in by Ido, a compassionate doctor who realizes that somewhere in this abandoned cyborg shell is the heart and soul of a young woman with an extraordinary past.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":79,\"title\":\"Hero\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vxgZto2Cz7ILHAlmRXt50I2brB2.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jDz6RYN3nKYtlo7J9IMvGoJit7B.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"During China's Warring States period, a district prefect arrives at the palace of Qin Shi Huang, claiming to have killed the three assassins who had made an attempt on the king's life three years ago.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Adventure\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":22164,\"title\":\"Blood and Bone\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4XoqjwKhqN3GlGt0fQtcY2OhkZq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1ecpXOwhQrMzoV3TrzqJELduQjo.jpg\",\"rating\":7.4,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In Los Angeles, an ex-con takes the underground fighting world by storm in his quest to fulfill a promise to a dead friend.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"OKNmiaNwn_M\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"nH7NEH_uENA\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"4_nx2TmkyMM\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}